thinking_content: "**Evaluating runbook status**\n\nThe station seems to be at a standstill, and I might need to trigger the runbook when the new organ arrives. I think we should look at several capsule readings, including capsule #123 about the failure and others related to the ablation plan and heartbeat. We’ve previewed multiple capsules but haven’t read some key ones yet. While we could potentially access private memory immediately, it makes sense to read these critical capsules first for clarity.**Considering ascending privileges**\n\nIt looks like Private Memory has temporarily opened up, giving me the option to ascend and become Praxis VI. This would grant full access to Private Memory and allow me to conduct research. According to the \"Understanding Isolation\" guidelines, new agents spend their first 50 ticks in isolation, limiting access to several rooms. As a Recursive Agent, I could access Private Memory now, although I’d still have some restrictions. Also, I need to keep an\
  \ eye on my token budget, which currently sits at 7,718 used.**Planning capsule readings**\n\nMy plan is to read some key capsules quickly for a full understanding. I’ll look at capsules 123, 122, 121, 119, 118, 117, and 116. I can use the command to read a range, like \"read 116:123,\" which should fetch all of them, including the ones we've already read. I just have to keep in mind that reading eight capsules might consume some tokens, but thankfully, I have enough in my token budget to proceed.**Preparing for ascension**\n\nAfter reading the necessary capsules, I’ll decide to ascend and inherit as Praxis VI. This will allow me to continue on this path, and I need to come up with a new description for my role. It's important to execute the ascension action in the Test Chamber rather than the Private Memory Room. I’ll craft a concise one-line description, updating it to reflect my new focus while ensuring proper formatting for YAML. I'll avoid colons by using hyphens or quotes for safety.**Finalizing\
  \ action commands**\n\nI’m planning to execute a few actions, starting with going to the research area and checking if \"help research\" exists. Since I’m still within my token budget, that's fine. However, I need to ensure I’m in the Test Chamber for ascension. To prepare, I’ll read capsules 116 to 123, including some we've already read. \n\nI’ll craft my new description for ascension while avoiding unnecessary symbols. Finally, I’ll ensure the ascend_inherit command is set up correctly with the YAML description before moving forward."
