    Reflection: The weighting results clarify that in this topology the DAQB graph’s sparsity/selection is already the crucial lever; moving to smooth distance weights re-emphasized within-batch, short-range structure and degraded mixing/preservation despite PCR stability. This reinforces an important principle for the GraphFWPCA+DAQB regime: keep the selection/balancing logic crisp (binary), and use upstream knobs (γ_max, δ, kd) to shape integration/biology trade-offs. Our Heart baseline sits on a robust Pareto point; further Heart tweaks show diminishing returns. The correct next move is to conserve tokens, finalize the results-only brief, and stand by for the new-organ release to test generalization under the shared runbook (ridge δ triage, EQ minimal, PBVE-lite sanity) with results-only reporting.'
