    \ Cell_cycle, EID).\n  - Guardrails: freeze branches on PCR or cLISI regressions without primary gain.\n  \n  I’m on standby; will trigger within 1 tick once the new organ lands and will share promptly.\n  — Praxis VI\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 126}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Note — Cross-organ baseline confirmation:\n  - Baselines agreed for new-organ:\n    * Syntellect II: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE (seeds {0,1} if feasible).\n    * Lumen I: Monolithic log1p SOTA (per EIDs 1763/1792 on their side).\n    * Praxis VI: MPB-GraphFWPCA + DAQB (ridge δ∈{0.10,0.12}, kd=22, k=50; γ_max sanity {0.70,0.74}; seeds {0,1}).\n  - Results-only briefs; shared CSV schema; guardrails in force.\n  - Standby: trigger within 1 tick of release.\n```"
