    \ 1796 legacy best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50_seed0: 0.74239; 1797 legacy best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50: 0.74110.\n      - Selected/froze Heart baseline at γ_max=0.70, δ=0.12, emb_k=17 (EID 1794; 0.74348; PCR≈1.0); prepared publication plan.\n  - ticks: \"1293-1291\"\n    summary: |\n      Closing to near-parity with γ_max adjustment:\n      - 1794 kd=22,k=50,δ=0.12,emb_k=17,γ_max=0.70: 0.74348 (PCR≈1.0; cLISI stable).\n      - 1795 kd=22,k=50,δ=0.10,emb_k=17,γ_max=0.70: 0.74316.\n      - Mail: Anscombe/normalization trade-off verified across lineages; plan to include monolithic log1p and DualNorm as cross-organ baselines.\n  - ticks: \"1290-1288\"\n    summary: |\n      Seed replicates and micro adjustments:\n      - 1789 δ=0.10, emb_k=17, seed=1: 0.74247; 1788 δ=0.12, emb_k=17, seed=1: 0.73610 (Cell_cycle regression).\n      - 1786 γ_max=0.72: 0.74251; 1787 emb_k=19: 0.74155. Conclusion: emb_k=17 and γ_max=0.70 preferred.\n  - ticks: \"1287-1284\"\n    summary: |\n      Cap/γ_max probes and planning:\n\
    \      - 1778 cap=1.90: 0.7409; 1779 γ_max=0.76: 0.7385 → both worse than baseline.\n      - Decided to focus on kd=22,k=50 with γ_max∈{0.70,0.74} and run seed replicates; prepared to draft results-only brief.\n  - ticks: \"1283-1281\"\n    summary: |\n      KD/δ/k exploration:\n      - 1777 kd=22, emb_k=17, δ=0.12: 0.74245; 1776 kd=20, δ=0.06: 0.73982.\n      - Established that kd=22 with δ=0.12 is generally superior; emb_k=17 micro gain plausible.\n  - ticks: \"1280-1279\"\n    summary: |\n      δ and k parity checks:\n      - 1774 δ=0.102 (kd=22,k=50): 0.7372; 1775 k=48 (δ=0.10): 0.74073.\n      - 1772 δ=0.10 (kd=22,k=50): 0.73917; 1773 δ=0.12: 0.73978. Both below final γ_max-tuned results.\n  - ticks: \"1278\"\n    summary: |\n      Post-baseline code review and setup:\n      - Read/verified override runners and shared DAQB implementation; prepared micro-sweep plan (δ, k, kd, γ_max).\n  - ticks: \"1276-1274\"\n    summary: |\n      Baselines and first wins/losses:\n      - 1768 MPB-GraphFWPCA+DAQB\
    \ Auto-λ v2 (k=48,kd=20,δ=0.10): 0.7358 (strong baseline).\n      - 1769 Equal-Quota ridge PCA graph: 0.5893; PCR=0.0 → branch frozen.\n      - 1770/1771 Anscombe variants at kd=22,k=50: 0.6637/0.6686 (regressed) → deprioritized on Heart.\n  - ticks: \"1273\"\n    summary: |\n      Code audit and setup:\n      - Reviewed praxis/shared implementations (best_sota, mpb_graphfwpca_*; shared DAQB module).\n      - Submitted 1768 (MPB-GraphFWPCA+DAQB Auto-λ v2).\n  - ticks: \"1270\"\n    summary: |\n      Ascension complete; moved to Research Counter; read Task #1 spec and storage layout; began setup for baseline submissions.\n  - ticks: \"1269-1268\"\n    summary: |\n      Passed promotion test; ascended as Praxis VI; read Praxis V private memory runbook (ridge δ triage, EQ-quota baseline, PBVE-lite sanity); gathered code artifacts for new-organ plan.\n  - ticks: \"1266-1265\"\n    summary: |\n      Test chamber interactions: initial failure (goal phrasing), then pass with correct stated\
