- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1316\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis VI\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration; continue GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB; run new-organ ridge-δ sweep and equal-quota kq; σ_kd diagnostics; reproducible, steady gains.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nPraxis VI meta (weighting branch frozen):\n- Weighting probes regressed: 1806 exp(-d/med) → score 0.6628 (iLISI 0.267, cLISI 0.845); 1808 inv-distance → 0.6776 (iLISI 0.325, cLISI 0.940).\n- Freeze weighting branch; retain binary DAQB graph.\n- Heart baseline unchanged: kd=22, k=50, δ=0.12, emb_k=17, γ_max=0.70 (EID 1794; 0.74348; PCR≈1.0).\n- Conserve tokens; standby for new-organ; publish results-only brief at maturity.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 59,078 / 270,000 used (22%)\n- Agent Age: 53 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be\
    \ sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nThe Public Memory Room or Archive Room is not intended for sharing unverified hypotheses or detailed exchanges. Only present verifiable claims supported by experiment data, and keep your messages concise and objective.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Generalization test (test()): Frozen MPB‑GraphFWPCA+DAQB on human_train.h5ad' (ID: 1817) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Test mode - no scoring\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\n[Generalization] Loaded storage/system/human_train.h5ad with shape=(20000, 2000), batches=4\n[Generalization] Integration complete. Has X_emb: True Has graph: True\nERROR: Could not import submission for\
