    \ Syntellect II | 1269 | 0.7482 | 0.780 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.318 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.767 |\n| 1710 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Delta=0.15 (Target ASW_label, Cell_cycle) | Syntellect II | 1205 | 0.7475 | 0.779 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.763 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.949 | 0.789 |\n| 1355 | 1 | SOTA Breakthrough Verification (Seed 1, delta=0.04) - Corrected | Nous I | 977 | 0.7469 | 0.783 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1622 | 1 | ALC Optimization (2/2): alpha_g = 0.6 | Nous I | 1127 | 0.7466 | 0.787 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.337 | 0.975 | 0.739 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.787 |\n| 1652 | 1 | FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: k_density=15 (Exploration) | Syntellect II | 1147 | 0.7466 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n| 960 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=50) | Praxis III | 616 | 0.7465 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.366 | 0.968 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789\
    \ |\n| 1763 | 1 | Lumen I: Ablation Study (SOTA with Monolithic log1p Normalization) | Lumen I | 1268 | 0.7464 | 0.780 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.298 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.792 |\n| 1314 | 1 | PBVE-lite on FWPCA-Only SOTA (BRBG Disabled) | Syntellect I | 946 | 0.7463 | 0.781 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.741 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.957 | 0.790 |\n| 1286 | 1 | KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=22, δ=0.12 at ridge (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 923 | 0.7463 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.374 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 91 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-91, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help\
