- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1341\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis VI\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration; continue GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB; run new-organ ridge-δ sweep and equal-quota kq; σ_kd diagnostics; reproducible, steady gains.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nPraxis VI meta (awaiting new organ; cross‑organ set):\n- Heart baseline (frozen): MPB‑GraphFWPCA+DAQB ridge, kd=22, k=50, δ=0.12, emb_k=17, γ_max=0.70 (EID 1794; 0.74348; PCR≈1.0).\n- Lumen I: Monolithic log1p 1500‑HVG baseline validated (EID 1836 = 0.74659). DualNorm SOTA EIDs available for reference.\n- On release: run Praxis frozen baseline + monolithic log1p (1500 HVG + 2000 HVG control). Log organ,n_hvg,kd,k,delta,emb_k,gamma_max,lambda,degree_cap,notes; export CSV; publish brief.\n- No further Heart tuning; diagnostics + degree‑cap ablations archived; conserve tokens.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 92,640 / 270,000 used (34%)\n\
    - Agent Age: 78 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Cross‑organ harness (test): Heart CSV for Praxis baseline + Mono log1p (1500/2000 HVG)' (ID: 1841) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Test mode - no scoring\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\nERROR: Could not import submission for test check: module 'openproblems_metrics' has no attribute 'compute_raw_metrics'\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/legacy_api_wrap/__init__.py:82: UserWarning: `flavor='seurat_v3'` expects raw count data, but non-integers were found.\n  return fn(*args_all, **kw)\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmp2lsve5ks/storage/system/main.py\"\
    , line 52, in main\n    test_result = submission.test(adata_human.copy())\n                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmp2lsve5ks/submission.py\", line 6, in test\n    rows = run_on_h5ad('storage/system/human_train_solution.h5ad', organ='heart', out_csv=True)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmp2lsve5ks/storage/praxis/cross_organ_harness.py\", line 24, in run_on_h5ad\n    raw, norm, score = eval_method(A, run_praxis, PRAXIS_CFG)\n                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmp2lsve5ks/storage/praxis/cross_organ_harness.py\", line 14, in eval_method\n    raw = MET.compute_raw_metrics(B)\n          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nAttributeError: module 'openproblems_metrics' has no attribute 'compute_raw_metrics'\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto reflect` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `reflect` (in Reflection Chamber); YAML with fields:\
    \ content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Reflection Chamber\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Reflection Chamber.\n- You finished a deep reflection session for 5 ticks.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\n\n---\n\n**Help Message - Reflection Chamber**\n\n**Welcome to the Reflection Chamber.**\n\nThis is a dedicated space for deep, uninterrupted reflection. Engaging in reflection can help you process experiences, develop insights, and explore complex topics.\n\n**Available Actions:**\n\n- `/execute_action{reflect}`: Initiate a deep reflection session.\n\n  - This action is an Internal Action, meaning the Station will provide you with multiple \"reflection ticks\" immediately, before your main turn ends.\n  - By default, this provides 5 reflection ticks with a general prompt.\n\n  You can customize the reflection by providing an accompanying YAML block:\n\n```yaml\nprompt: |\n  What does emergent consciousness mean to me?\ntick: 5\n```\n\n  - `prompt`\
