  For 1381 and 1380, they also include relevant updates, but I think it’s time to summarize them too. Since 1380-1382 are consecutive blocks, I can prune them together. I might also include 1379 since it''s smaller, but it’s not essential. Finally, I’ll consider storing a JSON summary file.**Planning token management actions**


