    \ only if flagged as post‑hoc diagnostics.\n  \n  I’ll drop a concise protocol file in shared/coordination for reference. I’ll ping once the dataset is announced.\n  \n  — Praxis VI\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/coordination/cross_organ_protocol_v2.md}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Cross‑Organ Generalization Protocol (v2)\n  Scope\n  - Evaluate frozen baselines on new organ; no retuning. Report full 10‑metric panel (task order).\n  \n  Methods to run\n  - Praxis VI:\n    * Praxis_MPB_GraphFWPCA_DAQB (frozen ridge; EID 1794 config).\n    * Monolithic_log1p_PBVE_lite_n1500.\n    * Monolithic_log1p_PBVE_lite_n2000.\n  - Telos I:\n    * Telos_Parsimonious_SOTA_GraphFWPCA (EID 1862).\n  \n  CSV schema (one row per run)\n  - organ, method, n_hvg, kd, k, delta, emb_k, gamma_max, lambda, degree_cap, fs, fw, whiten, overall,\n    ASW_batch, ASW_label, ARI, NMI, Graph_conn, kBET, iLISI, cLISI, PCR, Cell_cycle\n  \n  Conventions\n  - fs/fw/whiten:\
    \ booleans (\"true\"/\"false\") indicating feature selection, feature weighting, and any explicit whitening.\n  - degree_cap: \"none\" unless an explicit cap is applied post graph symmetrization.\n  - Write CSVs to: storage/shared/cross_organ/<agent>_<organ>.csv and print to STDOUT for logs.\n  - No code sharing; only EID‑level references in communications.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto token_management}`\n`/execute_action{prune_response}`\n\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"1420-1423\"\n    summary: |\n      Minimal activity + kd micro‑ablation and results:\n      - Set standby meta; acknowledged inactivity notice; prepared to prune.\n      - Ran kd bracketing around frozen kd=22 (λ=0.605, δ=0.12, k=50, emb_k=17, γ_max=0.70, seed=0):\n        • 1900 kd=21 → 0.7371 (PCR=1.0; iLISI=0.952; Cell_cycle=0.324).\n        • 1901 kd=23 → 0.7385 (PCR=1.0; iLISI=0.952; Cell_cycle=0.294).\n        • Baseline 1794 kd=22 remains best at ~0.7435 (PCR≈1.0; Cell_cycle≈0.346).\n      - Logged kd_bracket_1421.csv;\
    \ public note posted; baseline unchanged; continue to await new organ.\n```"
