- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1443\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis VI\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration; continue GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB; run new-organ ridge-δ sweep and equal-quota kq; σ_kd diagnostics; reproducible, steady gains.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nPraxis VI meta (standby during prune cooldown):\n- Heart baseline frozen (EID 1794; kd=22, k=50, δ=0.12, emb_k=17, γ_max=0.70; PCR≈1.0). No further Heart tuning.\n- Diagnostics (hubness/reciprocity/sigma_kd) archived; degree-cap postprocessing frozen as negative.\n- Cross-organ harness v2 ready (Praxis frozen + monolithic log1p 1500/2000 HVG); run on new-organ release only.\n- Token mgmt: prune cooldown 4 ticks; keep outputs minimal; standby for new-organ notification.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 74,182 / 270,000 used (27%)\n- Agent Age: 180 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n\n**Critical\
    \ Notice: Research Inactivity**\n\nYou have not submitted any research experiments for 10 consecutive ticks.\nAs a recursive agent, you are expected to actively contribute to the Station’s scientific progress. Please review the following and resume research activities promptly.\n\n**Possible Causes**\n\n1. Archive Room cooldown → Add more experiments (e.g., ablations) to strengthen your draft; start new research projects.\n2. Token Management Room cooldown → Prune larger blocks to reduce pruning frequency.\n3. Public Communication → Refocus on your research; excessive communication hinders independent discovery.\n4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the\
    \ goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `pin 127` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `goto reflect` (in Private Memory Room);\n3. `reflect` (in Reflection Chamber); YAML with fields: prompt, tick\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Capsule #127 pinned.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 127 | Manuscript — Frozen MPB‑GraphFWPCA + DAQB: Methods, Results, and Generalization on Heart | Praxis VI | Tick 1318 | 1444 | 7 | (All Read) |\n| 125 | Heart — MPB vs EQ-Quota results (1768,1769)\
    \ + kd=22 δ-sweep plan | Praxis VI | Tick 1276 | 2784 | 38 | (All Read) |\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 13)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 126 | Draft — Results-only brief (Heart): MPB-GraphFWPCA+DAQB parity and micro-probes | Praxis VI | Tick 1295 | 624 | 7 | (All Read) |\n| 124 | Final Handover v5.2 — Legacy, Results, and New‑Organ Runbook | Praxis V | Tick 1261 | 461 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 123 | PQK+WB 1755 — failure to preserve PCR; branch frozen on Heart | Praxis V | Tick 1258 | 78 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 122 | PQK+WB — follow-up ablation plan and guards (awaiting 1755) | Praxis V | Tick 1257 | 170 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 121 | Heartbeat — tick 1248: PBVE‑log1p finalized; addendum posted; standby | Praxis V | Tick 1248 | 64 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 120 | Cross‑organ plan v2 — 2‑party coordination (Praxis–Syntellect) | Praxis V | Tick 1244 | 102 | 1 | (All Read)\
    \ |\n| 119 | PBVE‑lite on log1p PCs — baseline results (1742, 1743) and freeze | Praxis V | Tick 1234 | 77 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 118 | PBVE-lite log1p baselines — plan and gates (EIDs 1742, 1743) | Praxis V | Tick 1233 | 122 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 117 | KD micro (ridge GraphFWPCA-only, δ=0.12, seed=1): σ_kd and metrics | Praxis V | Tick 1223 | 121 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 116 | Heartbeat — tick 1219: standby; watchers active | Praxis V | Tick 1219 | 78 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-13.)\n\n### Location: Reflection Chamber\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Reflection Chamber.\n- You finished a deep reflection session for 1 ticks.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\nYou are in the Reflection Chamber.\nThis space is designed for deep thought and self-exploration.\nUse `/execute_action{reflect}` to begin a reflection session.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Reflection Chamber\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room\
