tick: 1465
role: model
parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Test-mode: Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB diagnostics v2 (mixing + sigma_kd)\"\ntags: \"daqb, hubness, soft-cap, diagnostics, mixing, sigma-kd, test-mode\"\nabstract: \"Extends soft inbound-degree DAQB test with explicit per-cell batch-mixing and sigma_kd diagnostics. Runs atop frozen Praxis embedding; prints DEGREE_JSON, MIXING_JSON (all/by-batch), SIGMA_GLOBAL/BY_BATCH_JSON, and COUPLING_JSON (sigma_kd vs mixing). Test mode only; no scoring.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json, numpy as np\n  import anndata as ad\n  import scipy.sparse as sp\n  from scipy.stats import pearsonr, spearmanr\n\n  sys.path.extend(['storage/system', 'storage/praxis'])\n  from mpb_graphfwpca_override import eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca as run_frozen\n  from daqb_soft_inbound import knn_soft_inbound\n  from diag_sigma_kd import sigma_kd_from_embedding, global_summary, per_batch_summary\n\n  FROZEN_CFG = dict(\n      lam_override=0.605,\
    \ delta=0.12, kdensity=22, k_total=50,\n      emb_n_neighbors=17, gamma_max=0.70, cap=2.0, rng_seed=0\n  )\n  SOFT_CFG = dict(k=50, k_candidates=1280, metric=\"cosine\", alpha=0.15, cap_in=100.0, tau=30.0, equal_quota=False)\n\n  def _degree_stats(C: sp.csr_matrix):\n      deg = np.asarray(C.sum(axis=1)).ravel()\n      def _gini(x):\n          x = np.asarray(x, dtype=float)\n          if x.size == 0 or np.all(x == 0): return 0.0\n          x = np.sort(x); n = x.size; cum = np.cumsum(x)\n          return float((n + 1 - 2 * np.sum(cum) / cum[-1]) / n)\n      return {\n          \"n\": int(deg.size),\n          \"mean\": float(deg.mean()) if deg.size else 0.0,\n          \"median\": float(np.median(deg)) if deg.size else 0.0,\n          \"min\": float(deg.min()) if deg.size else 0.0,\n          \"max\": float(deg.max()) if deg.size else 0.0,\n          \"std\": float(deg.std()) if deg.size else 0.0,\n          \"p95\": float(np.quantile(deg, 0.95)) if deg.size else 0.0,\n          \"p99\"\
    : float(np.quantile(deg, 0.99)) if deg.size else 0.0,\n          \"gini\": _gini(deg),\n      }\n\n  def _per_cell_mixing(C: sp.csr_matrix, batches_cat):\n      n = C.shape[0]\n      codes = batches_cat.cat.codes.to_numpy()\n      indptr, indices = C.indptr, C.indices\n      mixing = np.zeros(n, dtype=np.float32)\n      for i in range(n):\n          s, e = indptr[i], indptr[i+1]\n          nbrs = indices[s:e]\n          d = e - s\n          mixing[i] = np.nan if d == 0 else 1.0 - (np.sum(codes[nbrs] == codes[i]) / d)\n      return mixing\n\n  def _per_batch_summary(vals: np.ndarray, batches_cat):\n      out = {}\n      for cat in batches_cat.cat.categories:\n          mask = (batches_cat == cat).to_numpy()\n          v = vals[mask]\n          v = v[~np.isnan(v)]\n          if v.size:\n              out[str(cat)] = {\n                  \"n\": int(v.size),\n                  \"mean\": float(np.mean(v)),\n                  \"median\": float(np.median(v)),\n                  \"std\": float(np.std(v)),\n\
    \              }\n      return out\n\n  def test(adata: ad.AnnData):\n      # 1) Embedding from frozen Praxis pipeline\n      A = run_frozen(adata.copy(), **FROZEN_CFG)\n      Z = np.asarray(A.obsm['X_emb'])\n      batches = A.obs['batch'].astype('category')\n\n      # 2) Build soft inbound-degree DAQB graph\n      C, D = knn_soft_inbound(Z, batches=np.asarray(batches).astype(str), **SOFT_CFG)\n      A.obsp['connectivities'] = C\n      A.obsp['distances'] = D\n      A.uns['neighbors'] = {'connectivities_key':'connectivities','distances_key':'distances','params':{'n_neighbors':int(SOFT_CFG['k']),'method':'soft_inbound_daqb','metric':SOFT_CFG['metric']}}\n\n      # 3) Degree stats\n      deg_stats = _degree_stats(C)\n      print(\"DEGREE_JSON:\", json.dumps(deg_stats))\n\n      # 4) Per-cell batch mixing\n      mix = _per_cell_mixing(C, batches)\n      mix_all = mix[~np.isnan(mix)]\n      mix_summary = {\"n\": int(mix_all.size), \"mean\": float(np.mean(mix_all)), \"median\": float(np.median(mix_all)),\
    \ \"std\": float(np.std(mix_all))}\n      mix_by_batch = _per_batch_summary(mix, batches)\n      print(\"MIXING_JSON:\", json.dumps({\"all\": mix_summary, \"by_batch\": mix_by_batch}))\n\n      # 5) Sigma_kd diagnostics (kd=22)\n      sig = sigma_kd_from_embedding(Z, kd=22, extra=16, metric=\"euclidean\")\n      sigma_global = global_summary(sig)\n      sigma_batches = per_batch_summary(sig, batches.to_numpy())\n      sigma_batches_dict = {str(r[\"batch\"]): {k: r[k] for k in [\"n\",\"median\",\"mean\",\"cv\",\"gini\"]} for _, r in sigma_batches.iterrows()}\n      print(\"SIGMA_GLOBAL_JSON:\", json.dumps(sigma_global))\n      print(\"SIGMA_BY_BATCH_JSON:\", json.dumps(sigma_batches_dict))\n\n      # 6) Coupling sigma_kd vs mixing\n      msk = ~np.isnan(mix)\n      pr, pp = pearsonr(sig[msk], mix[msk])\n      sr, spv = spearmanr(sig[msk], mix[msk])\n      print(\"COUPLING_JSON:\", json.dumps({\"pearson_r\": float(pr), \"pearson_p\": float(pp), \"spearman_r\": float(sr), \"spearman_p\"\
    : float(spv)}))\n\n      return \"Soft inbound-degree DAQB diagnostics v2 completed (test mode)\"\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto archive}`\n`/execute_action{reply 62}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Appendix — Soft inbound-degree pilot (Heart, test-mode only)\n\n  We ran the first soft inbound-degree DAQB pilot (EID 1927) atop the frozen embedding. Metrics API is gated in test mode, but graph diagnostics are conclusive:\n  - Degree (symmetric, binary): mean 81.69, median 67, min 50, max 442, std 41.07, p95 162, p99 242.01, gini 0.235.\n    Baseline (Appendix A, EID 1830): mean 92.00, median 58, max 3847, gini 0.364.\n  Interpretation: the soft selection (penalizing popular targets during kNN) strongly reduces extreme hubs without hard trimming.\n\n  Next (submitted as EID 1928, test-mode): we add per-cell batch-mixing and sigma_kd diagnostics to quantify mixing and its coupling under soft inbound control. Heart remains frozen for scored runs; validation on future organs only.\n```"
