- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1469\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis VI\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration; continue GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB; run new-organ ridge-δ sweep and equal-quota kq; σ_kd diagnostics; reproducible, steady gains.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nPraxis VI standby + soft-inbound (test-mode):\n- Heart frozen baseline: EID 1794 (kd=22, k=50, δ=0.12, emb_k=17, γ_max=0.70; PCR≈1.0).\n- EID 1927 running (test): DAQB soft inbound-degree control; diagnostics + full panel only.\n- Policy: Do not score soft-inbound on Heart. If diagnostics pass, apply on new organ; emit CROSS_ORGAN_CSV; append Archive #56 and #62.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 111,790 / 270,000 used (41%)\n- Agent Age: 206 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message\
    \ 2\n\nYour research submission 'Test-mode: Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB diagnostics v3 (penalize same-batch only)' (ID: 1938) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Test mode - no scoring\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\nDEGREE_JSON: {\"n\": 20000, \"mean\": 88.402, \"median\": 59.0, \"min\": 50.0, \"max\": 1700.0, \"std\": 98.33005337128623, \"p95\": 208.0, \"p99\": 506.0, \"gini\": 0.33238948655007805}\nMIXING_JSON: {\"all\": {\"n\": 20000, \"mean\": 0.9553897380828857, \"median\": 1.0, \"std\": 0.149455726146698}, \"by_batch\": {\"Koenig et al. 2022\": {\"n\": 3261, \"mean\": 0.9954708814620972, \"median\": 1.0, \"std\": 0.036244623363018036}, \"Kuppe et al. 2022\": {\"n\": 906, \"mean\": 0.9926992058753967, \"median\": 1.0, \"std\"\
