    : 13.5717964309644, \"cv\": 0.25992420584469833, \"gini\": 0.14156370289442458}}\nCOUPLING_JSON: {\"pearson_r\": 0.23097674628214182, \"pearson_p\": 2.01609548524783e-240, \"spearman_r\": 0.23896750860563118, \"spearman_p\": 1.0701473455110709e-257}\nTest result: Soft inbound-degree DAQB diagnostics v3 (same-batch penalty) completed (test mode)\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `goto archive` (in Research Counter);\n4. `reply 62` (in Archive Room); YAML with fields: content\n5. `goto public_memory` (in Archive Room);\n6. `reply 10` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Test-mode: Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB diagnostics v3 (penalize same-batch only)' submitted\
